    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Welcome to the Underground!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the gritty world of the drug trade, where every decision shapes your rise to power. Start as a small-time dealer, buying illicit goods on the dark web and selling them to local clients. As your empire grows, you'll need to outsmart rival gangs, expand your distribution network, and stay one step ahead of the law. Will you play it safe, or risk it all to become the ultimate kingpin? The streets are waiting\u2014how far will you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9 <strong>Build Your Drug Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a small town, flipping small deals, and slowly grow your operation. Buy on the dark web, find loyal customers, and avoid getting caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696 <strong>Risk, Rivalries &amp; Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart rival gangs, take over new territories, and make shady deals with corrupt cops to stay in business. Use force, strategy, or manipulation\u2014whatever it takes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Grow and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own production! Cultivate marijuana, set up labs, and create a vast distribution network to control the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>Survive the Underworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move has consequences\u2014failed deals, betrayals, and careless mistakes can lead to arrest or an all-out war with the cartels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Will you conquer the streets and become a legend?</strong> \ud83d\ude08</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d Welcome to the Underground!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the gritty world of the drug trade, where every decision shapes your rise to power. Start as a small-time dealer, buying illicit goods on the dark web and selling them to local clients. As your empire grows, you'll need to outsmart rival gangs, expand your distribution network, and stay one step ahead of the law. Will you play it safe, or risk it all to become the ultimate kingpin? The streets are waiting\u2014how far will you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd9 <strong>Build Your Drug Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a small town, flipping small deals, and slowly grow your operation. Buy on the dark web, find loyal customers, and avoid getting caught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696 <strong>Risk, Rivalries &amp; Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart rival gangs, take over new territories, and make shady deals with corrupt cops to stay in business. Use force, strategy, or manipulation\u2014whatever it takes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Grow and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own production! Cultivate marijuana, set up labs, and create a vast distribution network to control the market.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>Survive the Underworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move has consequences\u2014failed deals, betrayals, and careless mistakes can lead to arrest or an all-out war with the cartels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Will you conquer the streets and become a legend?</strong> \ud83d\ude08</p>",
    "short_description": "Start small, rise to the top! \ud83d\udcb0 Buy on the dark web, sell to clients, expand your network, and evade the law. Grow your own supply, strike deals with dangerous suppliers, and eliminate the competition. Will you dominate the drug trade and rule the streets?",
